  1. baseline 1 (responses in request order)
  2. baseline 2 (responses in request order)
  3. seed 1
  4. seed 2
  5. seed 3

Now run the same scenario 5 times, one page load each (reload or navigate fresh every time): load the page, do the user steps, then wait for `await page.evaluate(() => window.__GENCLASS_AGENT__.whenSettled(15000))`.
